p&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef9788ee66a5aa1b9218f229506daed2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello ! I really like your art ! I'd like to request art of my character Alioth he is a boy but cute like a girl !\nI would like to request an image that I can use on Youtube for my vtuber activities so please make the size 1920×1080\nI would like the image to be of Alioth laying down with stars surrounding him with a sleepy expression on his face. the rest is up to you !! \nThank you for your consideration\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EJIX7JRm0sX4_7pNxUE0hRLuO7vqXSov?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nelel_malakh210/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3866790b/uploads/origins/5b72c507-5534-4540-911c-4854c65bbff2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c20ddc1e306afac54e2ec4d9189e61d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3866790b/uploads/origins/5b72c507-5534-4540-911c-4854c65bbff2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c20ddc1e306afac54e2ec4d9189e61d, https://si.imgix.net/3866790b/uploads/origins/5b72c507-5534-4540-911c-4854c65bbff2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=96f4c438ed652c6c729c7317576197bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3866790b/uploads/origins/5b72c507-5534-4540-911c-4854c65bbff2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=29f3434019dbebf097b1202cdd8b579f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nelel_malakh210/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c8d62aeb/uploads/origins/ef52a10f-d98b-4d1f-8046-bf62d7af8183?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aeb501cf7cd3b2389b735a0603020d6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c8d62aeb/uploads/origins/ef52a10f-d98b-4d1f-8046-bf62d7af8183?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aeb501cf7cd3b2389b735a0603020d6, https://si.imgix.net/c8d62aeb/uploads/origins/ef52a10f-d98b-4d1f-8046-bf62d7af8183?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad6fe9e177e73655006366f04d314dc1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c8d62aeb/uploads/origins/ef52a10f-d98b-4d1f-8046-bf62d7af8183?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ed1ff4ca4a4054ddf8f995199278bdb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、狐のvtuberをしております、味醂さまと申します。\n聖ネルエルさんの素敵な絵を拝見し、リクエストさせていただきました！\n透明感のあるイラストとても素敵です！\n\n服装など資料URLの画像を参照していただければ幸いです。\nポーズの指定ございません、聖ネルエルさんのイメージで描いてくださると嬉しいです！\n\n形式はpdfかpng希望です。\n（透過背景がありましたらどちら形式でもありがたいです)\n\n使用用途はYouTubeの配信サムネやツイートに添付させていただきたいと思っております。\n\n宜しくお願い致します！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/mirinsama_v/status/1533340771360722945", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nelel_malakh210/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8637a62c/uploads/origins/c622750e-cacd-491e-88c1-8bd4c86a3a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9f3f05101931e9f343bea53c50230aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8637a62c/uploads/origins/c622750e-cacd-491e-88c1-8bd4c86a3a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9f3f05101931e9f343bea53c50230aa, https://si.imgix.net/8637a62c/uploads/origins/c622750e-cacd-491e-88c1-8bd4c86a3a91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6447332fde971d2dc17067a0a3e3b82 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8637a62c/uploads/origins/c622750e-cacd-491e-88c1-8bd4c86a3a91?bg=%23fff&auto=for